<InteriorLayout title="Website Terms | I.S Design + Build" description="Information about project enquiries, illustrative images and the use of this website." label="Website terms" headline="A starting point for your project.">
  <Fragment slot="intro"><p>This website introduces our services and helps you begin a project conversation.</p></Fragment>
  <section class="copy-section"><p class="cg-label">Using this website</p><div class="copy-body"><h2>Project information</h2><p>Website information is general. A project-specific review is needed to establish feasibility, scope, estimates, scheduling and any approvals. A website enquiry does not create a construction contract, confirm an appointment or authorize work.</p><h2>Enquiries and availability</h2><p>The email-preparation tool does not submit or confirm receipt of an enquiry. You must send the prepared message through your email application. Call <a href="tel:+12025191831">(202) 519-1831</a> to discuss a time-sensitive concern and confirm availability.</p><h2>Photography and illustrations</h2><p>The portfolio uses photographs from the company’s project archive. Images identified as design references, the animated kitchen illustration, the illustrative floor plan and background footage explain ideas and are not presented as completed company projects.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about the website or a project, email <a href="mailto:info@isdesignandbuild.com">info@isdesignandbuild.com</a>. Project terms are established in the relevant project documents.</p></div></section>
</InteriorLayout>
